  "details": "I've seen over the last few months that you only get like 4-5  instances of a public world such as The Pug that never cycle to new instances or refresh in the world tab. Like a year ago you could scroll through multiple instances that constantly refreshed to join different lobbies and meet new people. but now were oddly limited and I'd like the old instance functionality back since it feels odd that a game based on meeting new people is restricting that specific feature.\n\nThat or put a timer on that cycles new instances every couple of minutes so that we can still hop around and not be as limited, if keeping a short instance list is what your aiming for.",
